  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tertiary Scholarships Selection 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tertiary scholarships aim to progress development and workforce planning objectives of partner countries.
This activity is for services to select 431 scholars from approximately 82 countries and place them in Aotearoa New Zealand and Pacific tertiary institutions.
All services will be managed by&#xA0;operational partner, Education New Zealand.</narrative>
  </description>
